<title>HONG KONG: Shun Shing wins HK market contract.</title>
<headline>Shun Shing wins HK market contract.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shun Shing Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it won a HK$109.7 million contract to build a market building from Hong Kong's Architectural Services Department.</p>
<p>The contract covers the design and construction of the Sai Ying Pun Market and would boost the company's contracts-in-hand to HK$2.94 billion.</p>
<p>Outstanding value of uncompleted works is around HK$1.66 billion, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
